# PLAN-931 wrap-931 — the byte-exact 925 Wrap source (provenance
# a2c_rt_restore::SRC / D-925-2): two owned literals as view args of
# `mk`. Pre-931 the Rust emission freed both operand temps BEFORE the
# call (silent empty reads / E0596); the corrected emission frees them
# right after the call consumed them, then the verifier-planned record
# field cleanup runs at exit. Hand-audited oracle span=5 ("ab"+"cde").

